\contentsline {paragraph}{\normalfont \textit {\indent We, as the students of IIEST, consider ourselves honoured to be working with Dr.\ Malay Kule. The success of this project would not have been possible without his useful insights, appropriate guidance and necessary criticism.}}{1}{section*.3}%
\contentsline {paragraph}{\normalfont \textit {\indent We would pass our token of token of gratitude to the Department of Computer Science And Technoogy as well for providing us with the opportunity to be able to tackle real world problems while improving our problem solving ability and thinking capacity by organising this project. We all have learnt quite a handful of new skills and are eager to use them henceforth as well.}}{1}{section*.4}%
